{"t":"ASPI","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"ASP Isotopes Inc.","ko":"ASP아이소토프","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","employees":271,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://aspisotopes.com","summary_en":"ASP Isotopes Inc., a development stage advanced materials company, engages in the production, distribution, marketing, and sale of isotopes in South Africa,Hong Kong, and United States. It operates in two segments, Nuclear Fuels, and Specialist Isotopes and Related Services. The Nuclear Fuels segment focuses on the research and development of technologies and methods used to produce high-assay low-enriched uranium (HALEU) and Lithium-6 for the advanced nuclear fuels target end market. Its Specialist Isotopes and Related Services segment engages in the research and development of technologies and methods used to separate high-value, low-volume isotopes, such as C-14, Mo-100 and Si-28, for target end markets, including pharmaceuticals and agrochemicals, nuclear medical imaging, and semiconductors; provision of related services; and operation of PET labs. The company offers the Aerodynamic Separation Process (ASP) technology, which separates gas species and isotopes in a volatile state; and the Quantum Enrichment (QE) technology, which separates isotopes. It also produces and commercializes Molybdenum-100, Molybdenum-98, and Ytterbium-176 for the nuclear medical industry. In addition, the company develops Zinc-68, Nickel-64, and Xenon-129/136 for the nuclear medical industry; Lithium-7, Uranium-235, and Chlorine-37 for the energy industry; and Germanium-70/72/74 for semiconductor markets. The company was incorporated in 2021 and is based in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"ASP Isotopes Inc.는 개발 단계의 첨단 소재 기업으로 남아프리카, 홍콩, 미국에서 동위원소의 생산, 유통, 마케팅, 판매를 담당하고 있습니다. 핵연료와 전문 동위원소 및 관련 서비스라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 핵연료 부문은 첨단 핵연료 목표 최종 시장을 위해 고분석 저농축 우라늄(HALEU)과 리튬-6을 생산하는 데 사용되는 기술과 방법의 연구 개발에 중점을 둡니다. 전문 동위원소 및 관련 서비스 부문은 제약, 농약, 핵의학 영상 및 반도체를 포함한 목표 최종 시장을 위해 C-14, Mo-100 및 Si-28과 같은 고가치, 소량 동위원소를 분리하는 데 사용되는 기술 및 방법의 연구 및 개발에 참여합니다. 관련 서비스 제공; PET Lab 운영 이 회사는 휘발성 상태의 가스종과 동위원소를 분리하는 ASP(Aerodynamic Separation Process) 기술을 제공합니다. 동위원소를 분리하는 양자농축(QE) 기술도 있다. 또한 핵의료산업용 몰리브덴-100, 몰리브덴-98, 이터븀-176을 생산, 상용화하고 있습니다. 또한, 이 회사는 핵의학 산업용 Zinc-68, Nickel-64, Xenon-129/136을 개발하고 있습니다. 에너지 산업을 위한 리튬-7, 우라늄-235, 염소-37; 그리고 반도체 시장을 위한 게르마늄-70/72/74. 이 회사는 2021년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 댈러스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":1.18,"mcap":183884624.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-1.4131737,"peg":null,"ps":5.2985053,"pb":0.52631575,"ev_ebitda":-1.188,"div":0.0,"beta":3.785,"hi52":8.6,"lo52":1.03},"fin":{"rev":34705000.0,"rev_g":3.031,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.17875999,"op":-3.5119102,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.67825997,"fcf":-35833748.0,"cash":201663008.0,"debt":145000992.0,"de":40.358,"eps":-1.68,"feps":-0.835},"own":{"short":0.21959999,"inst":0.46789002,"insider":0.102469996},"analyst":{"n":3,"mean":13.0,"median":13.0,"high":15.0,"low":11.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-04-14","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":11.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-12-04","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-11-24","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":11.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-09-17","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":11.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-05-21","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy